%% 沙箱生命周期状态机（第 13 篇）
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Pending: POST /sandboxes
  Pending --> Running: 工作负载就绪
  Pending --> Failed: 调度或拉镜像失败
  Running --> Pausing: pause（202，异步）
  Pausing --> Paused: 快照成功 + 释放算力
  Pausing --> Failed: PauseFailed（快照不可用）
  Paused --> Resuming: resume
  Resuming --> Running: 同一个 sandboxId
  Resuming --> Failed: 检查点缺失或围栏不匹配
  Running --> Stopping: DELETE
  Stopping --> Terminated: 清理完成
  Stopping --> Failed: 非零退出
  Terminated --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]: 换新沙箱，不复活
